<section class="home-retailer">
  <div class="home-retailer-inner">
    <div class="home-retailer-copy">
      <span class="home-retailer-eyebrow">Wholesale</span>
      <h2 class="home-retailer-title">For retailers and distributors</h2>
      <p>Fungi Fusion sells on a sentence your staff can actually remember: calm, energy, clarity &mdash; one arc, three mushrooms, in a deliberate order.</p>
      <p>We formulated for a designed effect, not a dosing contest. That&rsquo;s why we&rsquo;re priced where we are.</p>
      <a href="/pages/wholesale" class="home-retailer-cta">Request wholesale pricing <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-retailer {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0B3D2E 0%, #1B5E42 55%, #2D6A4F 100%);
    padding: clamp(52px, 7vw, 88px) 22px;
  }
  .home-retailer-inner { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .home-retailer-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green-mid, #7FD1A6); margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .home-retailer-title {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.14; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .home-retailer-copy p { font-size: clamp(16px, 1.7vw, 19px); line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88); margin: 0 auto 16px; max-width: 640px; }
  .home-retailer-cta {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px;
    background: var(--yellow, #FFCB05); color: #16181B;
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; padding: 15px 32px; border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.12s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
  }
  .home-retailer-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
</style>

